V. Risk Monitoring

Risk monitoring is performed throughout testing and system operation.

- Check server and application availability regularly.
- Monitor payment gateway responses, failures, and timeouts.
- Monitor seat availability and temporary seat locks.
- Check for double-booking attempts during concurrent ticket sales.
- Monitor database backups and data integrity.
- Check user access permissions and security logs.
- Monitor network connectivity during booking and payment.
- Verify QR code and PDF ticket generation.
- Monitor promo code validation and discount calculations.
- Track email delivery failures and booking confirmation issues.
- Track errors and failed test cases and take corrective action.
- Re-test the affected module after fixing a risk-related issue.

